  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ca621741ab0b1bb13548af6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员平时为我做的努力，\r\n我会在比赛时好好报答的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b35f012bffd70dc0a81797f79aab64918d73ff432420806b80226b671f8595c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d42f09abbdca5be02180a112",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀哎呀！整个会场都很热闹呢～\r\n呵呵，连我也觉得充满精神了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "216236f5386dfce7a57e52c7c1f26ec1e672dc17df84f9b53f2bace7de19aa15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:463960596c344c7250068aa5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你很紧张吗？\r\n呵呵呵，只要跟平常一样就好了哦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ce00e258b9bd28f333417cda2ae8c0d308d4b02511667145a8b50184661893c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62ddf5ab8531444c98264a02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就快要开始了呢～\r\n呵呵，都觉得等不及了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aca00be80b5a0c0d3253699354ed34903c049e35194aaf1dfeb65030d1e73c05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d8e296bac462a72cac80a75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么都不用担心哦～\r\n只要跟训练时一样去跑，\r\n应该就会有好结果的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de10a4dfa5c02d6b68bada2a6522da0e687d28c7e122349b6e6e61d6cf865147",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3fd13a3e6963e6e0f896c41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打起精神～打起精神～\r\n这是我教小朋友的咒语哦，\r\n不知道对我自己有没有效呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f967507db491306251580a9c76ff6c3dca38749ca5dfc2fbfc2c3c4df8935d62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:212fa3af1813a492068426d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "老实说状态真的不太好……\r\n但我还是会努力去跑的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaba35f64bff9b3df21c3ef6ac88306483f8e77b61ec0e8cbbdf13f1c24ebe9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:369e8457c85b77cd13604f84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……我会加油的。\r\n因为我不想让训练员的努力白费……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5baa5da854067d011289c5e00870426d2bdc9b8fcc009fee1672f0183c4bfbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfd94cad9e884a768a1a2ea3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对不起，现在的我\r\n不确定能不能达到你的期望……\r\n但我还是会全力以赴的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d9c578a2257848f109ca0e471c666933a884a2ff0ebf06247fe8bd1fb666713",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7babc0f3c9ae98dad69f1c89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样的状态，不知道还有没有办法\r\n让训练员露出笑容呢……\r\n呼……好，我要努力才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf08325a82371de7a7f29c822e0dffcf3969784fc3c3d6b69f4671e7a12e0c8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8833b4c3e5b4048d8f0cc41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然现在状态真的不太好，\r\n但我也不会因为这样就放弃比赛的。\r\n要看着我哦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fc91c16104d6aaed5d738a2d2a14d924e7b04e185e8fc0c72831eae9917e659",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43d751a73b7bef0eb47c0de5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f748cbedee3dbec2c71793b331189d3b4b18994e03be5c7f04532449ec2754fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a28a2d47e6f93ba0131a10e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我们走吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "92c6e8d9de1f1658cad9481f73a4847cffa62df6b6f04724d53214b970c058b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a55977e31a27e6b4617320c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会努力的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "de23a0ded4a8151b8c0793e206121d6f6fc749fe24864482e9ac965f9f71e5f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0926c5150072a721287298e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "26ff4925698843c3792c7f0bc377e245a84f32db565113d4ccaa189fe812f9dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dc95f2f0afed8081f845a9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀呀……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff2fc41fc2a37ee08441f40c67d9ba7a9c82aa96fa79524ef44330e764709db9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a59088e74efcb98fa3684c21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dfb96d163733959e5250b066fab803d16c85e8be2ca2413aca9f44e91be5c0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5db3432c5c401f72060a6c57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要出发了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e27f10769fd2b4e32c26d444515a9a318789d1953ad91e331dd39daa283c956a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eb931fe6227b52cdfd5c2c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啪唰～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cd097bedde1ce7090d82bdc2f0d33f8dd07f7ea4c79da4e5bbb0be475136976",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0bf7789c4d5e8fe3c45436d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这都是训练员一直为我努力的关系♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "49400329c0694bbf93ed16da726e74f0449af3695ca39fa281edc7dbe31d2001",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e5f543c2c3496476e0ea3f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我度过了一段很愉快的时间～",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd64b3f7403dd3413a6ea7b14569d122ad14568f603ac04eea78731a03589167",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd96a702aecc280068bb760d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一起努力吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d6bdc1e685d5f7ddce226b53900877c8abcb2ad56333d80fdfe7c4ae6e255e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:843def637449580565fd491f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要为我加油哦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "16d752149f017c02cb05b0d2cf683f295b0f3c33b194cd4f725459d03f661e83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f65f06ec26ceb14504749ab",
