      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5b7f4c7c24247e4ea57026d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，你有觉得开心吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b71892bad773d4ecca6e6fe7bfd9c811e620737f952f94fe9353ddaff88ba1dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae24201e943cd9d49aa22fb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这也是因为有大家为我加油的关系～",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cfcfd5774c4bc6370f6a490097185eb39f2e8df5df437bbdd1ab5c67487b428",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a1ccb288cb8ac3c37fe5ef5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是不是就快要能看到最棒的笑容了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1966d365e7296d6bed8efa307c9d29b1279ce1021d6bb876785bc1b11f6587e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66e6494175af23957345b390",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……下次我会更努力的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "62aed5a4db68eef81e4eae3b84c1519683f31692d6d07cb46840a07c048bea36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:416ebaf66025cce9c9fa9869",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵呵……是第一名呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e97576ae2613e62060aa2276e56f29fe6d62b828171c5afdcfb709c5dbd41c6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:899cb3743562243413c887e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，呵呵……你有为我感到高兴吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2271909815a498a183b654aa5c120ed260e8869be6c02c7f169c030f0718dcff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cbafe8e3fb19dc69f2cb6f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对睡不着的孩子……\r\n施加想要撒娇的诅咒～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d8cffd0ce103e241c54dc4d7e7e09b1ce04cdb084ab51a381dea648568ee450",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d777d7e84caf74af45c1dd9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，呵呵……你有为我感到高兴吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2271909815a498a183b654aa5c120ed260e8869be6c02c7f169c030f0718dcff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c100f9e6c155e922889e6d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "忍者なのに、1番目立っちゃいました♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6e4e1939738e0036706b18a8c2522c34a6eaa1c17cf057b68e1e41df6ce5a73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "30206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d20970dc417a1259465fb949",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よしっ、ふふっ…喜んでくれましたか～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d82c2f90aa77ab00cad3bb3595813a3e12ded0cfcb16cf4b4479455de538a9ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa0f7301ab572e561cee8076",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要参赛了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad5cbfa40db91421203f58c15da7f2f1b6253afb0dc52b15b716644adc37a296",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab10eaeb6e19185bb61c3739",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了你的笑容……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f07774587bd3446912916a1f656ba0d9c6f6204ab00723ded6ad0eabc60437b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa772cf885af4e15fc0dff32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "にんにん！くのいちママ見参です！\r\n忍法・甘やかしの術～！練習の\r\nあとは、おやつがありますからね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a90781ac911735ec1eec9a37a13dfdf7ac3d2336894d1e52cbdfe6b2a8cbf2d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1ba8778a67222f2e6454fb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あの子ってば、反抗期かしら…！？\r\nどうしましょう、ちゃんと\r\n訳を聞かせてくれるでしょうか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dd0e25536b7196d49fec5c9f94fe88600ba866df64b8d2acb26dbd0a17c7369",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9800d01a4760efbfa43f1a12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……本来想说得要忍耐的，\r\n结果还是说出口了。看来我的\r\n照顾能力……还有待加强呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb15a5a894d4ae59e0cc154b5e7d7fa9659b4f7eca3f6f6425c8940f10c30d7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae42a451c3544346804b98fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了你的笑容……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f07774587bd3446912916a1f656ba0d9c6f6204ab00723ded6ad0eabc60437b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84894bf4070431dfe296f5d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这里是活动任务♪\r\n呵呵呵，\r\n努力的孩子就在这里吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe65076fcb86019de914e7a8cd0f7eb79cd54ef274a7d223682a1c1ea81dbff6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f41c87af7a953218fc0bd64d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也要好～好领取\r\n活动任务的奖励。\r\n……不可以忘了哟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc6f18ca67b448677887b0a941cac60506a7a60aa05810aa7ce8b65ac693edc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf74cc559a058fdc63e716b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要上场咯～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94a890def78e6ceca578617737d6895a190ce4f9d3b2e9d9053a93db309935b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "40002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9b6dc2ceca0ed24790acfdd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请永远对我撒娇♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3f36042a34d34be06acbaf4931e7f14531c2bda2a9b54b6784ddddf26da9fa3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f541f609c31007aeeb77c7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵……派对现在才要开始。\r\n来吧～可以永远对我撒娇喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6481b5a2af7236d64d0860f4303b5e7061ed7ca47ef09e2b13ac14aa893fcfcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:982508557f8aa7b25d34433e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もう強くなった子ほど、もっと\r\n強くなるのは難しいんですよね。\r\nだけどヤエノちゃんなら大丈夫…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f6e1c8c2ff21e1056f3038d4c86f29a5cd1d5d7dbca7140a33ca4c86a588f00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "400075"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cee76d3d9a77a10d46cbff2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いいこいいこの術～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3910e9a067f50c159764c1b4cf673e7b02d317f9f8e47dbf1bf2da3b17a9fcca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "40203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af7817d8a66c70929b009546",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "む。困ったちゃんは忍法で成敗！\r\nお覚悟を～♪にんにん♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "43cdaf72e47b5aee68ba6299679743acf9294e9fc2596de7b341e6286f9c8067",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "40204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:075aa2ed26cf732ce8cb6a37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，要尽情地享受哦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f17bdc4fc90c6187da995b8b5da3a046234ef195d43d048e76cbb3634c712f6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7db4d03546141336b6be968f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会让大家都露出笑容的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "97d3b9dd0b8de73b95f48dc8af79180b85d4dcd18e8e000dc60b47fb7fe7d6b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96ec5b363be49329bf0ea363",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，以后我也会努力帮忙的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88587734b0962a28daad5bd5e93267837cf8ffcebd9bbccfba1336827b393412",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72af83d0177938966c15d869",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从第一次看见训练员\r\n不安的表情开始，\r\n我就一直忍不住想要溺爱你啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bcf63f32f157745425e9ecdf5be03b3d4ab3196753b50943a8de2a7511cc0da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18759a1936052eb139b93480",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，适合我吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b45a807d0eba98e11753722c02d5116c2ed89bced70854fcc122a0b33c2e7722",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ee39ed37ec280af9e0c78c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这真的是很用心制作的衣服呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3675d8d636299a1f98fc3ae472dc14cb42c51b57427766175b9809b781d5443",
